### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare P99 request latency by function with CPU, storage and request rate. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
An expensive request mix, overloaded proxy/query nodes or storage delays.

### Fix
Address the measured bottleneck and tune expensive operations before increasing concurrency.

### Verify
P99 request latency in seconds returns below the threshold. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
